# Onion Rings (windurst 42): the offer's operands. The two first quests completed by GM, level 5. Inspector's Gadget
# accepted (not completed): section 1's quest operand false alone: not available; its own 414. Completed by GM:
# available; fame 124 (level 2): 422; fame 125 with this quest's char-var mustZone set by GM (nothing else sets it):
# 422; a warp out and back (cleared): 429 (Prog 1, EndTime).
lists PortWindurst/Kohlo-Lakolo/onTrigger
char zone=PortWindurst pos=-27.5,-8.0,189.6 lvl=5
fame Windurst 124
quest Windurst.TruthJusticeAndTheOnionWay completed
quest Windurst.KnowOnesOnions completed
quest Windurst.InspectorsGadget accepted
login
trigger Kohlo-Lakolo                           # Inspector's Gadget accepted, no moustache: its 414
finish
quest Windurst.InspectorsGadget completed      # GM
trigger Kohlo-Lakolo                           # fame level 2: 422
finish
fame Windurst 125                              # GM
charvar Quest[2][42]mustZone 240               # GM
trigger Kohlo-Lakolo                           # the mustZone: 422
finish
warp -24.5,-14.498,262.994 WindurstWalls
warp -27.5,-8.0,189.6 PortWindurst             # the mustZone cleared
trigger Kohlo-Lakolo                           # 429
finish                                         # Prog 1, EndTime
